      "title": "Reflexive Pronouns: Recap",
      "content": [
        {
          "block_id": "BLOCK010",
          "type": "list",
          "introduction": "Remember:",
          "list_style": "bulleted",
          "items": [
            "Use a -self word when the doer is also the receiver.",
            "-self for one, -selves for more than one.",
            "Blamed her: someone else. Blamed herself: the same person.",
            "Enjoy yourself, help yourself, hurt yourself.",
            "By myself means alone."
          ]
        }
